#: ../../concepts/lifecycle.rst:2
msgid "The request lifecycle"
msgstr "请求生命周期"

#: ../../concepts/lifecycle.rst:4
msgid "Knowing the order of hooks is how you pick the right one. Each stage finishes for every extension before the next stage starts, and extensions run in ascending ``priority`` (lower numbers first)."
msgstr "了解钩子的顺序，才能选对钩子。每个阶段都会对所有扩展执行完毕，才进入下一阶段；扩展按 ``priority`` 升序运行（数值小的先执行）。"

#: ../../concepts/lifecycle.rst:26
msgid "Because ``on_tool`` always completes before ``on_state``, a guidance extension can describe every tool no matter which extension registered it. Priority only changes the order *within* a stage."
msgstr "由于 ``on_tool`` 总是在 ``on_state`` 之前完成，提供使用准则的扩展可以描述每一个工具，无论它是哪个扩展注册的。优先级只改变同一阶段\\ *内部*\\ 的顺序。"

#: ../../concepts/lifecycle.rst:31
msgid "One turn"
msgstr "一个轮次"

#: ../../concepts/lifecycle.rst:51
msgid "Emit UI progress from any hook with ``await context.emit(AgentEvent(...))``. The event becomes visible to whoever is consuming ``Agent.stream()``."
msgstr "在任何钩子里都可以用 ``await context.emit(AgentEvent(...))`` 发出 UI 进度，正在消费 ``Agent.stream()`` 的一方就能看到这个事件。"

#: ../../concepts/lifecycle.rst:55
msgid "Which hook should I use?"
msgstr "该用哪个钩子？"

#: ../../concepts/lifecycle.rst:61
msgid "Hook"
msgstr "钩子"

#: ../../concepts/lifecycle.rst:62
msgid "Use it for"
msgstr "用途"

#: ../../concepts/lifecycle.rst:63
msgid "``on_tool``"
msgstr "``on_tool``"

#: ../../concepts/lifecycle.rst:64
msgid "Registering request-scoped tools."
msgstr "注册请求级工具。"

#: ../../concepts/lifecycle.rst:65
msgid "``on_state``"
msgstr "``on_state``"

#: ../../concepts/lifecycle.rst:66
msgid "Restoring history and adding system instructions."
msgstr "恢复历史记录，并添加系统指令。"

#: ../../concepts/lifecycle.rst:67
msgid "``on_message``"
msgstr "``on_message``"

#: ../../concepts/lifecycle.rst:68
msgid "Rewriting the user's input before it is sent."
msgstr "在用户输入发送出去之前改写它。"

#: ../../concepts/lifecycle.rst:69
msgid "``before_model``"
msgstr "``before_model``"

#: ../../concepts/lifecycle.rst:70
msgid "Anything that must change immediately before a model call, including compaction."
msgstr "必须在模型调用前一刻改变的内容，包括压缩。"

#: ../../concepts/lifecycle.rst:71
msgid "``after_model``"
msgstr "``after_model``"

#: ../../concepts/lifecycle.rst:72
msgid "Reading the response, usage, or recording a checkpoint."
msgstr "读取响应、用量，或记录检查点。"

#: ../../concepts/lifecycle.rst:73
msgid "``before_tool`` / ``after_tool``"
msgstr "``before_tool`` / ``after_tool``"

#: ../../concepts/lifecycle.rst:74
msgid "Approving, rewriting, or observing one tool call."
msgstr "审批、改写或观察一次工具调用。"

#: ../../concepts/lifecycle.rst:75
msgid "``after_run`` / ``on_success``"
msgstr "``after_run`` / ``on_success``"

#: ../../concepts/lifecycle.rst:76
msgid "Persisting results and releasing per-request state."
msgstr "持久化结果并释放请求级状态。"

#: ../../concepts/lifecycle.rst:77
msgid "``on_error`` / ``RunCancelledEvent``"
msgstr "``on_error`` / ``RunCancelledEvent``"

#: ../../concepts/lifecycle.rst:78
msgid "Cleaning up after a failure or cancellation."
msgstr "在失败或取消之后做清理。"

#: ../../concepts/lifecycle.rst:81
msgid "Success, failure, cancellation"
msgstr "成功、失败与取消"

#: ../../concepts/lifecycle.rst:83
msgid "Cleanup needs all three paths:"
msgstr "清理需要覆盖这三条路径："

#: ../../concepts/lifecycle.rst:85
msgid "A model or hook error calls ``on_error`` and propagates the original exception."
msgstr "模型或钩子出错时会调用 ``on_error``，并向上抛出原始异常。"

#: ../../concepts/lifecycle.rst:86
msgid "Cancelling the request publishes ``RunCancelledEvent``; ``on_error`` and ``on_success`` do not run."
msgstr "取消请求会发布 ``RunCancelledEvent``；``on_error`` 和 ``on_success`` 都不会运行。"

#: ../../concepts/lifecycle.rst:88
msgid "A tool failure is different: it becomes an unsuccessful tool result so the model can react, rather than failing the whole request."
msgstr "工具失败则不同：它会变成一条失败的工具结果，让模型能据此应对，而不是让整个请求失败。"

#: ../../concepts/lifecycle.rst:91
msgid "See :doc:`../extending/hooks` for every hook and :doc:`../extending/state` for a cleanup pattern that handles all three."
msgstr "所有钩子见\\ :doc:`../extending/hooks`；能覆盖这三种情况的清理模式见\\ :doc:`../extending/state`\\ 。"

